title: >-
  Reservoir Regulation Reshapes Recoverable Information in Daily
  Stream-Temperature Records
abstract: >-
  Software for detecting regulation-linked donor and memory structure with
  controlled stream-temperature outages. The study uses three Upper Jinsha
  stations and an evaluate-once five-site Chattahoochee confirmation. This
  citation is for software only; Jinsha observations remain restricted.
